{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22640","headline":"八月十五日夜禁中独直对月忆元九 · 白居易","name":"八月十五日夜禁中独直对月忆元九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"银台金阙夕沈沈，独宿相思在翰林。\n三五夜中新月色，二千里外故人心。\n渚宫东面烟波冷，浴殿西头钟漏深。\n犹恐清光不同见，江陵卑湿足秋阴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22640.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22640","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}